    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="El. 49.2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> El. 49.2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Þa hie ða ongeaton, þæt him ne speow, ða sendon hie ærendgewrit to him. Þis is ðonne þæt ærendgewrit þe ða apostolas sendon ealle to Antiohhia ⁊ to Syria ⁊ to Cilicia, ða sint nu of hæðenum ðeodum to Criste gecirde:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">When they perceived that they had no success, then they sent a written message to them. This is the document that the apostles sent together to Antioch and to Syria and to Cilicia, which were then newly turned from heathen observances to Christ:</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ða hy ða ongeaton, ðæt him ne speow, ða sendon hy [æ]rendgewrit to him. [Ð]is is ðonne þæt ærendgewritt ðe þa apostolas sendon ealle to Antiochia ond to Syria ond to Cilitia, ða sind nu of hæðnum ðeodum to Cryste gecyrrede.</ab>
      </div>
